(5988791, 875997, 41337, '<td valign="top">I guess the literal depiction is what gets this rejected? Not bad but nothing is a real standout. A crisper less limp looking flame would have helped you a lot.</td>', 'I guess the literal depiction is what gets this rejected? Not bad but nothing is a real standout. A crisper less limp looking flame would have helped you a lot.', '2010-05-04 01:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5988800, 877171, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. I like how you got the highlights to look like eyebrows pointed downward. The font work is good but everything is a little too dark and the bluish white balance does nothing for me. It would work better if it was brighter and with true whites, IMO.</td>', 'Nice effort. I like how you got the highlights to look like eyebrows pointed downward. The font work is good but everything is a little too dark and the bluish white balance does nothing for me. It would work better if it was brighter and with true whites, IMO.', '2010-05-04 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
