(5994505, 876616, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice job putting this together. The toys look good. Woody''s back could use a little touchup (i.e. the haloing and edge jaggies) but otherwise really nice compositing. I like how you laid out the text. However, the blue font color at the top doesn''t really go with the rest of the color scheme and is also harder to read. Well done.</td>', 'Nice job putting this together. The toys look good. Woody''s back could use a little touchup (i.e. the haloing and edge jaggies) but otherwise really nice compositing. I like how you laid out the text. However, the blue font color at the top doesn''t really go with the rest of the color scheme and is also harder to read. Well done.', '2010-05-06 16:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994514, 876718, 41337, '<td valign="top">Ha. I like the imagery but the bold font is a turn off. Given your theme I would have suggested something that was more subtle and faded in for a ghost-like effect or woven into the water so that it felt like it was slipping away into another time if that makes sense. Anyway, it''s not a design contest. Good luck.</td>', 'Ha. I like the imagery but the bold font is a turn off. Given your theme I would have suggested something that was more subtle and faded in for a ghost-like effect or woven into the water so that it felt like it was slipping away into another time if that makes sense. Anyway, it''s not a design contest. Good luck.', '2010-05-06 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
