(5996127, 876234, 41337, '<td valign="top">The idea/concept isn''t exactly new but hey it looks like a poster and there is no doubting the rejection part so not bad at all.</td>', 'The idea/concept isn''t exactly new but hey it looks like a poster and there is no doubting the rejection part so not bad at all.', '2010-05-07 18:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996146, 876491, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like you went all out here. I like it. However, there are some inconsistencies in the illustration that I feel hurts it a little. The best part is the skull and the eye. The two are very consistent tone-wise and look as one. This is in contrast to how the chest cavity looks which I can tell was built from various parts that weren''t photographed under the same light. <br/> <br/>That said, it''s not an easy piece to pull off and the end result is pretty good, all things considered. Good luck.</td>', 'Looks like you went all out here. I like it. However, there are some inconsistencies in the illustration that I feel hurts it a little. The best part is the skull and the eye. The two are very consistent tone-wise and look as one. This is in contrast to how the chest cavity looks which I can tell was built from various parts that weren''t photographed under the same light.  That said, it''s not an easy piece to pull off and the end result is pretty good, all things considered. Good luck.', '2010-05-07 19:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996148, 875741, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice design work. Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice design work. Good luck.', '2010-05-07 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5996159, 876954, 41337, '<td valign="top">This location gets a lot of play here at DPC and always seems to do well. I''ll be curious to see if that continues here. I don''t like the font especially the one at the bottom. However, it could have worked had the imagery supported it. In other words, Freddy just doesn''t look scary and neither does a view of Seattle.</td>', 'This location gets a lot of play here at DPC and always seems to do well. I''ll be curious to see if that continues here. I don''t like the font especially the one at the bottom. However, it could have worked had the imagery supported it. In other words, Freddy just doesn''t look scary and neither does a view of Seattle.', '2010-05-07 19:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
