(5996211, 875774, 41337, '<td valign="top">Funny. Just some advice, had your concept (i.e. E.T. falling) had some connection to the movie it would have worked even better, IMO. For example, having a bunch of E.T.s stuffed in the bike''s basket and maybe one falling out would still meet the challenge but also have added something more (i.e. the wordplay "extra" terrestrial).</td>', 'Funny. Just some advice, had your concept (i.e. E.T. falling) had some connection to the movie it would have worked even better, IMO. For example, having a bunch of E.T.s stuffed in the bike''s basket and maybe one falling out would still meet the challenge but also have added something more (i.e. the wordplay "extra" terrestrial).', '2010-05-07 19:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
